  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Aurora Fantasy\"></p>\n<p>Aurora Fantasy 是一款 Minecraft 着色器包，旨在將您的世界轉化為充滿魔法、夢幻且具電影感的氛圍。它專注於鮮豔的奇幻光照、發光的夜間螢火蟲、豐富的色彩以及呈現極光（Auroras）的迷人夜空。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"版本 5.4 更新內容\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>錯誤修復與 <span style=\"color:#f92aff\">相容性</span></strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>玩家水下可見度</strong></span>：修復了在 Minecraft 26.2 版本中，當其他玩家觀看時，水下玩家無形的錯誤。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>The End（終界）中的 Distant Horizons</strong></span>：修復了在 Minecraft 26.2 中使用 Distant Horizons 模組時，該着色器在終界維度無法正常運作的問題。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>夜間可見度與下雨</strong></span>：改善了夜間可見度，並修復了夜間下雨時的顯示問題。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>雨中的極光</strong></span>：修復了一項故障，即夜間下雨時極光天空效果仍會顯示的問題。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>功能與改進</strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>發光的夜間螢火蟲</strong></span>：能照亮夜間環境的魔法螢火蟲（可在設定中選擇關閉此功能）。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>雨窪</strong></span>：重新設計了雨窪，具有更高的視覺品質，並提供完全關閉此功能的選項。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>增強的雨景氛圍</strong></span>：改進了雨滴的視覺效果和日夜下雨時的整體大氣效應。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>全新的太陽與月亮</strong></span>：徹底重新設計的太陽和月亮，呈現出更佳的奇幻風格。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>簡化的配置文件</strong></span>：將圖形設定精簡為兩個主要配置文件：平衡模式與極限模式。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>一般調整</strong></span>：各種效能優化及小錯誤修復。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"媒體\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph1\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph2\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph3\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/4.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph4\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/5.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph5\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/6.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph6\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/7.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph7\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/8.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph8\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/9.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph9\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/10.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph10\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/11.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph11\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/12.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph12\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/13.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph13\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/14.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph14\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/15.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph15\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/16.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph16\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/17.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph17\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/18.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph18\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/19.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph19\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/20.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph20\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/21.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph21\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/22.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph22\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/23.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph23\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/24.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph24\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/25.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph25\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/26.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/4.png?raw=true\" alt=\"主要功能\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>空靈的夜晚與螢火蟲</strong></span>：北極光（極光）、逼真的星星以及魔法般的發光螢火蟲，共同裝點夜空。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>大氣雲層</strong></span>：動態雲層和柔和霧氣為地平線增添了深度和生機。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>流動的水體與精緻的雨景</strong></span>：逼真的波浪、清晰的水面反射、透明的雨滴以及動態的雨窪。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>現代反射效果</strong></span>：在水面和潮濕表面採用高畫質的螢幕空間反射（SSR），呈現精緻的視覺風格。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>沉浸式天氣系統</strong></span>：在沙漠生物群落下雨時，呈現逼真的塵暴和沙塵暴效果。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>優異的效能表現</strong></span>：設計用於在各類硬體配置上高效運行。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>超遠距離支援</strong></span>：相容於大型渲染模組，如 Distant Horizons（可在着色器設定中切換）。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>簡化的圖形配置文件</strong></span>：可快速選擇「平衡」或「極限」預設值。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/5.png?raw=true\" alt=\"技術需求與效能\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>平衡模式</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>Minecraft 26.1.2 及更早版本：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1050（或同等級別）</span>：運行顯著更加流暢，可提供 40 至 60 FPS（平均約 50 FPS）。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>Minecraft 26.2（要求較高）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1050（或同等級別）</span>：平均提供約 30 至 40 FPS。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1660（或同等級別）</span>：平均提供約 40 FPS。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>極限模式</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>Minecraft 26.2（要求較高）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1660（或同等級別）</span>：平均提供約 35 FPS。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">（<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">注意</span>：建議使用更高階的 GPU 才能在 Minecraft 26.2 的極限模式下達到 60 FPS）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/6.png?raw=true\" alt=\"致謝與授權\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKDXavier\" rel=\"nofollow\">KDXavier</a></strong></span>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fmakeup-ultra-fast-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUp - Ultra Fast</a></span> 着色器的原始創作者</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fin2bubble\" rel=\"nofollow\">in2bubble</a></span></strong>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252faurora-fantasy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora Fantasy</a></span> 的着色器修改</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fEntokito\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entokito</a></span></strong>：額外的着色器代碼（根據 LGPL v3.0 授權使用）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/kosua20\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simon Rodriguez</a></strong></span>：FXAA 3.11 抗鋸齒演算法</p>\n<p><strong>授權條款</strong>：GNU 較通用公共許可證 v3.0 (LGPL v3.0)</p>\n<p><strong>原始 GitHub（未修改分支）</strong>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/MakeUpUltraFast\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUpUltraFast</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>修改後的 GitHub 儲存庫</strong>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora-Fantasy</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>支援與問題回報</strong>：如有任何問題或意見回饋，請直接在 CurseForge 的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/aurora-fantasy/comments\" rel=\"nofollow\">評論區</a></span>中回報。</p>",
